# Local preview variables for `npm run preview` (wrangler dev).
# Copy this file to `.dev.vars` and fill in real values — `.dev.vars`
# is gitignored and never committed. The same four values are set in
# the Cloudflare dashboard for the deployed Worker (see DEPLOY.md).
#
# NEXTJS_ENV: which Next.js .env file to load (default "production").
NEXTJS_ENV="production"
# ADMIN_PASSWORD: the admin panel password (same value as .env.local).
ADMIN_PASSWORD="change-me"
# NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_URL: the public URL of the deployed site, e.g.
# https://sweet-cravings.<your-subdomain>.workers.dev
NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_URL="http://localhost:8787"
# TURSO_DATABASE_URL: libsql://<database>-<org>.turso.io
# (for a local preview test, a file: URL works too — see DEPLOY.md).
TURSO_DATABASE_URL=""
# TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN: the database token from the Turso dashboard.
TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN=""
